# Final runtime artifacts live in dist/. The uncompressed core.dump is
# intentionally not tracked by Git because it exceeds GitHub's 100 MiB
# regular-Git object limit. core.dump.gz is the canonical tracked form and
# release workflows reconstruct core.dump from it when needed.
/dist/core.dump

